                "text": "$$\\leq$$ $$\\pi$$ $$t-\\frac{\\pi}{4}$$ $$\\leq$$ $$2\\pi$$ \\n $$\\frac{\\pi}{4}$$ $$\\leq$$ $$\\pi$$ $$t\\leq$$ $$\\frac{9\\pi}{4}$$ \\n $$\\frac{1}{4} \\leq t \\leq \\frac{9}{4}$$ \\n The period is $$\\frac{9}{4}-\\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{8}{4}=2$$.",
